{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_12fce_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_12fce_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"一些選擇","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_12fce_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"53c10ff44e7b86a92cfd71a8d870eefa5ae2ae507e5841d1cadffc77470f7712","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"只是一個普通人的過往。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"你不應該跟著我。\n在我前去的地方有永不停息的戰火。\n你只是累贅而已，沒必要自尋死路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"薩弗拉，你怎麼還杵在那，嫌命太長嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"*薩卡茲粗口*，快找個掩體蹲下，炮火來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，還活著嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"還好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的狙擊點暴露了，時間不多，現在馬上轉移！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼快又再來？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊，該死！我的小腿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"（施展法術）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，謝了兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過是利用一下掩體，舉手之勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"腿還好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"小問題，不知道受過多少次這樣的小傷了。包紮一下就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不說我，兄弟你也不像很能打的樣子，竟能撐到現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"看你用源石技藝挪動掩體來掩護的樣子，手法老道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你這是第幾次上戰場了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然做過不少訓練，但是這還是第一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"到現在也全憑運氣，不是什麼大不了的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你還挺謙虛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不過說真的，再這麼僵持下去可不是個辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"上頭的人倒是輕鬆，但我們這可吃不消啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"看來這裡就我們倆了，不知道其他人如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"我和其他人失散了......原本的突襲任務失敗了，敵人衝散了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"前面一點動靜都沒了，看來衝到前方的隊員都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，那可真是巧，我也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經不指望他們能回來幫我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是任務失敗了，我可不準備在這裡倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"我去四周偵察下，一定有逃出包圍圈的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"偵察？你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是看不起你，兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但我敢保證，不管你的源石技藝能幫你製造多少掩體，只要你的白色腦袋露出來，對面的炮火馬上就能把你炸得稀爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"還不如我們先在這裡觀望觀望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"三點鐘方向......有敵人來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的庫蘭塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"對面的是輕裝庫蘭塔傭兵。雖然可能還有其他敵人......通常會協同作戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"等他們衝過來，就沒地方能逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"可能還配備了術師無人機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你，怎麼知道得這麼清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"簡單的推斷，猜測，經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"可能有猜錯的，但是大致如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然現在出去可能比較醒目，但是我們的位置躲不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"知道得這麼清楚，那豈不是你也能輕鬆幹掉他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"憑我的源石技藝可做不到，估計一出手就會被敵人解決掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，只是逃跑就已經拼盡全力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈看來雇你來上戰場的雇主也是看走了眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"打敗仗的原因竟然是太摳門只能雇來這樣的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......之前沒來得及問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"薩弗拉，你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"我的名字很多，現在叫我46A就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，這個是名字嗎？聽上去像是什麼家用電器的編號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"其中一個代號而已，暫時就這樣叫我就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"聽你這麼說，看來是你自己也沒想好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"名字也許不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，看來你和我一樣，見機行事混口飯吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是聽到炮彈的聲音了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"走，46A，快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"當了那麼久傭兵，我還是第一次看到引導炮火的無人機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這年頭那些無人機術師越來越難對付了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"要是早點發現，我們也不至於死那麼多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"我在腳印上做了些偽裝，希望能多爭取點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是什麼源石技藝都會啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"可不可以幫我治療下傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我沒學習過醫療源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我也就隨便說說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的醫療兵是第二個失蹤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"別在意，兄弟。常有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒有你，我早就被那幫庫蘭塔捅穿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人沒逃出來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"看來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但這也意味著，我們安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你還走得動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那就不休息了，集合點應該在前面不遠，以我們的速度，再走一個小時左右就能到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這次啊，這次可真是站錯隊了，那幫領主開價那麼高，我還以為是穩操勝券呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"結果幾發炮彈掉下來，所有人都在往後跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜了那幾個和我長期合作的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"錢是到手了，命也交代了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，46A，你也是被他們高價騙來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要一些補給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈別說得這麼文縐縐的。用命換錢，大家都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"也在找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"找人，在戰場上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？家人還是仇人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這可，太有意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這看上去還挺像你的脾氣，不過你想要在這樣鬼地方找恩人，怕不是被騙了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人救了我，而且——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了。聽我一句勸，小心別被利用了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛不好意思說，你這傢伙也夠奇怪了。現在我可要提醒你了，你覺得卡茲戴爾的哪裡能找到你那個恩人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不好那個人根本沒有打算救你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"想想看你給幹過活的那些雇主、還有夥計，哪一個不是說翻臉就翻臉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"也許見面以後，那人反手就——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒想到竟會出現這樣的失誤，完全沒有注意到敵人的攻擊。\n爆炸物？法術？\n耳鳴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"narration","text":"但是，不能死在這裡。\n就算是看不見，就算是爬，也要活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"你總是能活下來，薩弗拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我沒想到，你能活到現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"你和那些殘渣不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"你能活到現在，我姑且認同你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"而我，也應當給你一個結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"面對過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"或是面對未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩弗拉虛弱地，握住了法杖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"這次，我可以跟著您嗎，巨梟？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"小夥子，該醒醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"12F","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"12F","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，您怎麼在這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"今天別人都有事，只有你和老夫倆薩弗拉在這裡喝悶酒談天說地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"想起來點沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"12F","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好像......是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"給，冰水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"12F","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"再揉揉眼睛兩邊，用力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"12F","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這是老夫年輕時醒酒的方法，效果怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"12F","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了，多謝您，老先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，都是自己人，不用那麼客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這是老夫的偏方，只對薩弗拉有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"12F啊，你剛剛是夢見什麼了嗎，我看你好像身體繃得很緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"12F","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是做了個奇怪的夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"12F","speakerId":"char_009_12fce","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，想到了一些過去的事情而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你叫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"46A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我沒有名字，只有代號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從今往後，你就跟著我好了。如我所說，會有更多的危險等著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能走到哪裡，就看你自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在的你，已經死在這裡了。今天是你的死期，也是你的誕辰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，作為禮物，就由我來給你一個新的名字好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天是，3月3日......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那，以後你就叫12F好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_009_12fce","aliases":["？？？","12F","46A"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
